## How to get there

Start directly from Triemli tram station.
<JourneyPlanner from="<current location>" to="Zürich, Triemli" toFixed time="10:00" target="arrival"/>

The first ascent is quite strenuous.
<HikeImage idx={0} />
<HikeImage idx={1} />
After that, the route follows the ridge at a leisurely pace. A relaxing walk in fine weather.
<HikeImage idx={2} />
<HikeImage idx={3} />


## Journey home

By bus from the Albis Pass to Thalwil, then home by train.
<JourneyPlanner fromFixed from="Langnau a.A., Albispasshöhe" to="<current location>" time="15:00" target="departure"/>
